  "modmenu.nameTranslation.mousedanmu-remastered": "MouseDanmu Remastered",
  "modmenu.descriptionTranslation.mousedanmu-remastered": "A client mod that displays Bilibili live danmaku in Minecraft in real time.\n\nUse '/dm connect <room_id>' to connect to a live room; use '/dm' or '/mousedanmu-remastered' to view all commands.\n\nMain features:\n- Real-time danmaku, gifts, super chats and guard messages\n- Customizable subtitles, styles and gift effects\n- Send danmaku\n\nDisclaimer:\nThis mod fetches live danmaku through Bilibili's public interface. Using your user Cookie to send danmaku is optional and carries account risks. Use at your own risk.",
